          <div class="wordmark"><span class="n" style="font-size:22px">Slapping Studs</span><span class="s">SIJHV &middot; EST. 1982 &middot; ENSCHEDE</span></div>
          <p class="body" data-ed="ft.b">The oldest student ice hockey association in the Netherlands, affiliated with the University of Twente.</p>
